  "custom_logic_notes": "OsMA 4-color logic classifies histogram bars into 4 colors: (1) OsMA>0 and rising=bullish strong, (2) OsMA>0 and falling=bullish weak, (3) OsMA<0 and falling=bearish strong, (4) OsMA<0 and rising=bearish weak. Long entry on bullish colors (especially on zero-line crossover from below), short entry on bearish colors (especially on zero-line crossover from above). The EA uses previous bar values (shift=1 and shift=2) for color determination and current bar (shift=0 or shift=1 depending on new-bar logic) for signal generation. Opposite signal closes existing position before entering new one.",
